[gd_scene load_steps=6 format=3]

; Cold-storage fridge: the plain "kitchenFridge" model (the same one the fridge
; station uses) with a delivery of goods stacked on its top. The kit fridge is a
; closed box (its door faces +Z, towards the game camera), so there is no shelf
; to see into: the goods sit on the top face at y = 0.92, which the 50 degree
; game camera looks straight down onto.
;
; Every child is a Kenney model used as-is; the whole prop is scaled by 2 at
; runtime (FurnitureDef.scale_mult), so the food-kit children sit at 0.35 = the
; game's own food size (0.7 world). They all stay inside the fridge's own
; footprint (x 0..0.43, z -0.282..-0.02), so the piece still measures 1x1 cells
; after the x2 scale. The cheese wheel is a little smaller than the food-kit
; scale on purpose: at 0.35 it would be 48 cm across and swamp the fridge top.

